  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI Gnalis-Rafai BeAfrica Innovation Lab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Business services..Beneficiaries: YALI Youth 79 of which 36 are women...BeAfrica Innovation Labs (Bailab) solution is to provide services to companies, and business executives, including outsourced bookkeeping, financial consulting, specific workshops sessions, and later acceleration program for aspiring entrepreneurs. Potential investors will be able to better assess our clients (SMEs) which will lead to increased access to capital and moreover will have increased transparency and better management practices...The USADF funds will be used to: (a) upgrade accounting software; (b) increase office technical capacity; and (c) materials and equipment needed to conduct training for 60 financial professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
